{
 "_report": "Neonis, rebuilt on the V3 world kit. The landing ring on the Starport deck (062) stays the arrival; the kit Spaceport (666) sits west of it with the ship home (gate). Town = Starport deck 062 + Neon Boulevard 063 (both kept, story/quest spots, Courtroom door) + Neonis Lane Homes (662), then the Neon Crossroads hub (643) with Quiet Court north (663: apartment, Recording Studio, Arcade Hall 180 reused as kit Arcade Hall) and Farmstead Edge south (664: Neonis House 176) leading east to the Neon Megadome (635 -> lobby 636 -> battle floor 637). Recovery Bay 064 and Shop 065 swapped to the kit rooms (doors from both 062 and 063). East of the hub, Signal Junction (644) branches: north up Skyline Overlook (647) to the Undercity Tunnels cave (639 entrance + 640/641/642, maxrevive chest in the deep chamber); east to Voltspire Plaza (659) whose door opens the Voltspire (069 = kit Trial Floor, 071 = kit Keeper Room, DJ Static keeper at 12,4); south down Bassline Ramp (646) to Canal Fork (645, water edge): west to the Glowgarden Hideaway (654, hidden dead end, fullgel chest), east to the Helix Front Office (652 -> Helix Secret Lab 653), south along Canal Quay (648) -> Broadcast Plaza (651) -> Arcade Alleys (066 reused, keeps S53 quest spots) -> Static Canal (650, dead end, harmonic chest). Broadcast Route A/B (067/068) and Voltspire 2F (070) dropped; their NPCs moved to 644/647/069 and their wild tables reused.",
